WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.380
Brothers and sisters, wisdom means seeking
God's kingdom and righteousness first.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:11.172
Look at our schedules. Outside working
hours, do we first make time for the church

00:00:11.172 --> 00:00:11.540
life?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:19.480
When we face difficulties at work, do we
seek God first?

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.260
Or do we first seek help from others, and
only turn to God when nothing works?

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:31.220
Through my decades in the workplace, God has
often taught me one thing:

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.280
“Come to Me first.”

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.760
“Do not come to Me only as a last resort.”

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.980
Come to the Lord first. Come to Him first.

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.320
Put God's kingdom and righteousness first.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:48.420
I read that Brother Watchman Nee said all
Christians will eventually mature.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.160
Those who mature first are the overcomers.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.780
Late maturity means remedial lessons in the
millennium.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.820
It is a matter of order—a matter of
priorities.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:09.940
Let us first know the Lord, love Him, and
place ourselves in the church life.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:18.320
Be active, not passive like Lot, who
gradually drifted into the world and into
Sodom.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:23.960
He was surrounded by Sodom's corruption and
did not even notice.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:29.100
Like a frog in warming water, we stop
noticing.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:35.700
If we put God's kingdom and righteousness
first, we will not drift into Sodom.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:46.589
Seek His kingdom and righteousness first,
rather than merely scraping by in this evil

00:01:46.589 --> 00:01:47.300
world.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:50.620
We need not be like chickens scratching
along the ground.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:53.840
I am not saying we do not need to work on
earth.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:59.160
But we can be seated with Christ in the
heavenlies. That is what He said.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:02.440
His word is truth. Believe it and receive
it.

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:08.505
We are seated with Christ in the heavenlies,
and then we walk on earth. It is a matter

00:02:08.505 --> 00:02:09.140
of order.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:15.572
Ephesians first speaks of being seated with
Christ in the heavenlies, then of how we

00:02:15.572 --> 00:02:17.180
should walk on earth.

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:28.840
The order is crucial. Seek His kingdom and
righteousness first. Put God first.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:34.200
First make time for the church life. That is
wisdom.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:44.650
A relationship with God is the most glorious
and noble thing there is.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:48.150
Nothing is more precious than a relationship
with God.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:56.898
Even when circumstances go badly and our
prayers go unanswered, we can still have a

00:02:56.898 --> 00:02:58.310
relationship with Him.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:08.010
To stand undefeated, treasure knowing Christ
above all else.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:14.050
In good times, thank Him. In hard times, we
can still know Christ.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:18.750
What can go wrong then? There is no defeat,
is there?

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:26.330
The secret of standing undefeated is to
treasure knowing Christ above all else.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:30.250
Even in adversity, I can know Christ. That
is already a gain.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:36.434
In good times, do not be ungrateful or self-
important. Do not think, “I defeated four

00:03:36.434 --> 00:03:37.710
kings with 318 men.”

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:45.090
It was Jehovah. Jehovah delivered the
enemies into our hands.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:49.190
If He had not delivered them into our hands,
we would already have been destroyed.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:55.810
Putting Christ first is more than a slogan.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:04:03.670
Letting Christ have first place means
seeking Him first at work and in our
families.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:11.086
Ask five people and add your own opinion:
six opinions can leave you completely at a

00:04:11.086 --> 00:04:11.490
loss.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:16.390
One Lord and one God are enough. Let us seek
the Lord first.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:24.423
Take part in the church life and read the
Bible first. Knowing what He will do, you

00:04:24.423 --> 00:04:27.170
will not be frightened by the news.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:35.630
The Bible is clear. The world is moving in
the direction described in Scripture.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:44.450
God has not held anything back from us. Paul
also said he had not held anything back.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:50.399
On that day we cannot blame God. It is
written plainly in the Bible. If we do not
read

00:04:50.399 --> 00:04:51.990
it, who is responsible?
